WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:06.940
When I heard that we were chosen by the Shinju-sama, I thought that was an amazing thing.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.900
But exactly how amazing it was, I didn't fully realize.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.490
Just that, once I heard that the enemies
that were coming would destroy the world,

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.200
I thought that I must fight.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.920
In the beginning, I lost myself in that feeling.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.760
At that time, even in my dreams, it never even occured to me that we would end up sacrificing our bodies to keep fighting on

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:05.620
Today's miso soup was made by Ojou-sama herself.

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.630
I hope it's to your liking.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.630
It looks delicious.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.630
I'll have some.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.370
Good morning!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.880
'Mornin, Washio-san

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.670
Good morning.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.850
Aah! I'm sorry, mother!

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.270
Huh? I'm not at home?

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:11.520
Nogi-san, we're inside the classroom before the morning homeroom.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.150
Washio-san, 'morning~

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.150
Good morning.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.030
Good morning, everyone.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.030
Heya, heya!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:25.120
Whew, I made it.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.000
Minowa Gin-san, you're late.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.210
Ouch! That hurt, sensei!
Minowa Gin-san, you're late.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:31.040
Hurry up and take your seat.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.750
Mino-san's as energetic as always.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.630
Hey Gin-chan, why are you late today?

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:39.430
A lot of things happen when one's in sixth grade.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.970
Ehee?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:45.390
I forgot my textbooks!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.810
Now then, today's person on duty.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.690
Yes!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.020
Rise!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.020
Bow!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:03.450
It's thanks to the Shinju-sama that we are here today.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.450
Give thanks to the Shinju-sama.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.410
Be seated!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:17.670
Isn't this...

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.690
It has finally come...

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.280
the day when we fulfill our duty.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.760
It's here!
Waaah, so bright!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.320
Whoa!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.900
It's my first time seeing it! This is...

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.110
The Shinju-sama's barrier?

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.500
Episode 1
Washio Sumi

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:32.040
Is this the world created by the Shinju-sama's barrier?
Whoa... amazing!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.040
Jukai?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.000
It's just as they taught us, huh?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.670
Amazing, right? It's all trees!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.220
Is that the Great Bridge?

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.590
Yeah, that's probably it!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.770
The bridge that connects our world to the outside.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.270
That's where the enemies will be coming from, huh.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:58.230
I'm so excited that we got to be chosen as Heroes!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.570
Minowa-san, this isn't a game!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.110
Yeah, I know.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.900
Huh? Take a look over there!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.040
It's here.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.420
That's the enemy?

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:23.550
Once that crosses the bridge and reaches the Shinju-sama,

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.550
the world will end.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.550
Yeah, I know.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.140
It's up to us three to stop it, right?

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:32.140
Let us fulfill our duty!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.980
<i>Things that come from heaven and earth shall not leave</i>

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:43.320
<i>As a god, declare your arrival and presence</i>

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.200
<i>Souls rise up to call down the power of the gods</i>

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:52.830
<i>The gods called down by the souls are summoned now</i>

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.760
Whoa... our first battle!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.390
We haven't had joint exercises, though...

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.980
That's because the enemy appeared earlier than expected.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.110
Well, we'll be fine, right?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.110
Let's be cautious and defeat it.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.780
All right! I'll beat it up!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.110
Mino-san, me too!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.820
Both of you, wait up!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.960
It's so huge! Definitely different from training!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.750
And to think that this was our city a while ago!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.340
It's a wonder, isn't it, Washio-san?

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.600
Whoa, it's huge!

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.100
This is...

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.020
The being from the other side... Vertex.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.570
Ah! Look!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.320
Corrosion!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:37.120
The longer it takes for us to defeat it, the more adverse effects it will have on the other world!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.450
Well, then!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:39.990
Wait for me!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:40.790
Wait!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.410
A swift attack!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.750
What's this?!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.050
Mino-san!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.010
Girls!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.810
I did it!

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.160
Ah, geez!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.700
Nogi-san!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.620
Oh, no!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:36.470
I didn't know this could be a shield!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.520
Hurry up!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.280
It's just like a typhoon!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.400
We have to do something!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.990
I'll do it!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.290
It can't be!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.380
Washio-san!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:43.580
How do we defeat this?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.930
Washio Sumi's Chapter
Yuuki Yuuna is a Hero

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:59.680
My arrow's damage isn't enough...

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.760
Minowa-san can't get close enough...

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.970
Nogi-san is... I have no idea how to use her.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.640
How do we defeat it?

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:12.690
Watch out!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.610
Don't move, it's dan—

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.900
Minowa-san!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.870
Mino-san...

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.660
It's too resilient...

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.760
Mino-san, are you all right?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.680
She drank it all...

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:53.190
For Heroes who have god-like powers,
drinking water is no biggie!

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.520
I feel sick!

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:58.690
Mino-san, you're amazing!
How's the taste?

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.740
First it was like cider, then it suddenly
turned into Oolong tea...

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.700
That sounds gross...

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.290
That aside, the Vertex!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.410
That thing's dangerous!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.750
Those smaller spirits are just too many...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.960
It's close to the exit.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.960
We have to give chase!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.380
But we weren't effective, right?

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:22.090
But if we don't hurry, it will get across the Great Bridge!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.680
If it gets across we won't be able to defeat it, huh...

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.760
Let's do it again with more guts!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.600
I suddenly got an idea!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.200
It noticed us!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.960
Look over here!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.670
We have to hurry!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.000
Here it comes!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.800
Expand!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.600
This spear can become a shield!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.010
How convenient, Sonoko!

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.520
We can advance with this!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.650
Nogi-san, you okay?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.190
Heroes are about guts! Push it back!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:28.620
One-two, One-two!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.530
Washio-san, you too!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:38.880
One-two, One-two!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.920
Now! Charge!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:45.720
Washio-san!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.970
It's hard to aim!

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.140
Mino-san, I'm going to swing you around!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.680
Do it!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.100
Here I go!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:56.940
Minowa-san!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:12.490
Not another step!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.250
Mino-san!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.750
How's that?!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.190
This is...

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.280
The Flower Calming Ceremony?

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:04.840
Mino-san, you okay?

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:07.760
Yeah, I finished it with guts!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.680
It's started thanks to you!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.430
It's pretty...

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.810
It disappeared?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.460
It subsided.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.210
Did we...

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.670
repel it?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.260
We did it!
We did it!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:10.530
Oh, I see. It doesn't mean we end back at school...

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.450
This is bad! We're in indoor shoes!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.910
You're right!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.410
I got pictures of the Jukai!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.210
Huh? The Jukai disappeared!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.080
You can't photograph it, huh?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.170
Hey, Washio-san?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.420
Sumi-san?

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.430
Sumisuke?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.930
It was a narrow victory.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:45.730
I couldn't win it by myself.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:03.000
Like I told you yesterday, these three have
an important duty to the Shinju-sama.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.540
That's why, like yesterday, they may
suddenly disappear from the classroom,

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:13.300
but don't panic and make a scene. Instead, relax and cheer for them from the bottom of your hearts.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:17.890
You all have a daily obligation to study hard, after all!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:23.560
Hey, hey, is your duty hard? Is it painful?

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.900
Oh man, I can't talk about it, you see?

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.860
Eeeh? So stingy!

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.690
Come on, tell us!

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.700
Hey, Nogi-san, Minowa-san.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:45.160
If you don't mind, umm, can we have a victory party after this?

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.420
Oh! sounds great!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.670
Yeah! Let's have one!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:18:02.310
Umm... I am glad that we are able to gather today without incident.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:06.560
Umm... On this beautiful day in the year 298,

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:12.270
we hold this victory party in honor of the Heroes' First Battle.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:17.650
I wish all participants prosperity, good health, and a bright future...

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:18.780
That's too stiff!
I wish all participants prosperity, good health, and a bright future...

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:19.110
That's too stiff!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.910
Cheers!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.200
Thank you so much, Sumisuke.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:33.380
I've always thought about inviting you, but I couldn't get the chance.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.380
This makes me so happy!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:39.470
Mhmm! Isn't it the first time Washio-san has invited us to do something?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.470
That's actually true!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:46.850
We didn't have any joint exercises, but we still did pretty well for our first battle, right?

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:52.060
Right? I was so excited and wanted to really talk about it.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:59.240
To be honest, I also wanted to talk to you two...

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.450
That's why I invited you.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:07.250
You know, I thought that I couldn't trust you at first.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:11.710
It's not that I dislike both of you.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.800
I have a hard time depending on others, you see...

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.510
Sumisuke...

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:21.640
But that isn't the right thing to do, is it?

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:26.680
I... I'm sure I couldn't have done anything alone...

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.390
It's because both of you were there...

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.810
So...

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.360
Um...

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:38.860
Could you be friends with me?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.240
We're already friends, aren't we?

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:49.120
I'm happy! I actually wanted to be friends with Sumisuke, too!

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:53.670
See, I have a hard time making friends.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:54.790
Nogi-san...

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.630
You were actually thinking the same thing, huh?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:00.550
That makes me so happy, Sumisuke...

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.760
Umm, Nogi-san...

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.050
Yes!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:09.020
Why did you start calling me "Sumisuke" all of a sudden?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.640
Ah, I already gave you a nickname before I knew it...

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.060
You weren't aware yourself?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:21.570
I-I'm happy about that... but I don't think I like it much...

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:25.160
How about "Wasshina"? Doesn't it have an idol ring to it?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.450
Definitely not.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.290
Eeeeh?

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:31.540
Nogi-san, you wouldn't want to be called "Sonokorin", right?

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.040
Ah, how beautiful!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.170
I'm sorry. Forget I said that.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.040
Ah, an idea!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.880
How about "Wasshi"?

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.060
Fine, I guess that's good.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.930
I'll be in your care, Wasshi!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.640
Yeah!

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:54.940
All right! Just call me Gin!
Yeah!

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:58.060
All right! Just call me Gin!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.690
Minowa-san sounds too formal.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.190
That's right.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.610
Umm...

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.240
Oh, well!

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:14.710
Okay! To celebrate, let's try out this store's unique gelato!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:15.670
Eh?

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.460
This makes me happy!

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:23.340
The roasted Uji and Calpis flavors blend so well together!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.880
What's yours, Mino-san?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.550
The Shouyumame gelato!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.550
What's that? But it looks delicious!

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:33.270
An exquisite flavor!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:38.100
The slight bitterness of the matcha blends with the flavor to create a superb harmony!

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.690
Aaaan!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.030
What?

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:45.110
If it's that delicious, aaan!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.080
Umm... this is my first time, so...

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:55.120
Delicious! It's our first group work, isn't it?

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.670
That's a weird thing to call it...

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:04.050
I've always wanted to try doing this with friends.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:05.340
How about you, Wasshi?

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:09.090
Eh? Um... me too. Ah, no!

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:51.400
Year 298 of the Divine Era.

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:55.490
This is the story of three Heroes.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:59.370
The fairy tale of the girls chosen by the gods.

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:04.880
In any age, it is always pure girls which catch the eyes of the gods.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:09.670
And often, the result of that is...
